00:33:18.180 --> 00:33:21.560
The day they filmed the scene with all the babies was my day off.

908
00:33:21.560 --> 00:33:26.040
And I wanted to be home with my baby, not bringing my baby to work.

909
00:33:26.560 --> 00:33:28.020
So I wasn't in it.

910
00:33:28.100 --> 00:33:29.360
And they said, don't worry, Angela.

911
00:33:29.540 --> 00:33:30.740
We're going to get Isabel in there.

912
00:33:30.880 --> 00:33:31.680
And they did.

913
