She ended up having a very fun day on set years later at Cece's Dance Recital.

914
00:33:36.820 --> 00:33:37.480
I can't wait.

915
00:33:37.700 --> 00:33:38.180
I know.

916
00:33:38.640 --> 00:33:41.380
Well, Michael's going to try to make the best of it, OK?

917
00:33:41.460 --> 00:33:46.680
He is going to present Astrid to the office, and they're going to go into the conference room.

918
00:33:46.880 --> 00:33:51.040
Jenna, he does the Lion King and holds the car seat over his head.

919
00:33:51.040 --> 00:33:51.640
I know.

920
00:33:51.720 --> 00:33:53.360
I hope that was fake baby day.

921
00:33:53.600 --> 00:33:55.900
That was fake baby, and that was all scripted.

922
00:33:56.240 --> 00:33:56.980
Oh, boy.

923
00:33:57.560 --> 00:34:03.480
Well, when we move into the conference room, Kevin is like, you know, the fact that the

